# The infra shell (OpenTofu, sops, the FIDO2 plugin, tofu-state-key) instead of the root one: modules/flake/infra.nix.
# nix-direnv only rebuilds its cached shell when flake.nix/flake.lock change: also watch what the shell reads.
watch_file ../modules/flake/infra.nix ../modules-private/meta/endpoints.nix ../modules-private/meta/keys.nix
use flake ..#infra
